B.PM=s(["I was associated with the Aesthetic movement.","I became famous for my wit, fashion and public lectures.","I wrote a play featuring Lady Bracknell.","One of my works centres on a portrait that ages instead of its subject.","I wrote Salome.","I wrote The Importance of Being Earnest.","The Picture of Dorian Gray is my only novel.","I was born in Dublin.","I was an Irish playwright, poet and novelist.","My first name is Oscar."],t.s)
