B.Qo=s(["My landscape is officially divided into lower, central and upper geographical regions.","My federal system contains three territorial regions and three language-based communities.","I became an independent country following a revolution in 1830.","My highest point is Signal de Botrange, situated in the High Fens.","I have three official languages: Dutch, French and German.","I am a constitutional monarchy with a short coastline on the North Sea.","I was one of the twelve founding members of NATO.","My capital hosts NATO headquarters and several major European Union institutions.","I am famous for waffles, chocolate, chips and hundreds of varieties of beer.","My capital is Brussels, and I lie between France, the Netherlands, Germany and Luxembourg."],t.s)
