B.Ud=s(["My territory is divided into 47 prefectures.","Approximately three-quarters of my land is mountainous.","My four principal islands are Hokkaido, Honshu, Shikoku and Kyushu.","I sit where several tectonic plates meet and experience frequent earthquakes.","Mount Fuji is my highest mountain and an enduring national symbol.","My high-speed passenger trains are commonly known as the Shinkansen.","My currency is the yen.","Cherry-blossom viewing is a celebrated seasonal tradition here.","I am an East Asian island nation lying in the Pacific Ocean.","My capital is Tokyo."],t.s)
B.ZS=new A.aX("countries_country_silhouettes_0003","Japan","assets/images/categories/countries/country_silhouettes/countries_country_silhouettes_0003_japan.webp",B.Ud,B.N)
B.Sa=s(["My federation consists of six states and two principal mainland territories.","My Indigenous peoples maintain cultures extending back more than 60,000 years.","The Great Dividing Range runs for thousands of kilometres near my eastern coast.","A vast dry interior is commonly called the Outback.","The Great Barrier Reef lies off my north-eastern coastline.","Tasmania is a large island state to my south.","The kangaroo and emu appear on my national coat of arms.","I am both a sovereign country and the only nation governing an entire continent.","Sydney is my largest and most internationally recognised city, but it is not my capital.","My capital is Canberra."],t.s)
