B.SB=s(["My mainland stretches for more than 4,000 kilometres from north to south while remaining unusually narrow.","The Atacama Desert occupies much of my far north.","The Andes form a natural boundary along most of my eastern side.","I administer Rapa Nui, also known as Easter Island, far out in the Pacific.","I lie on the Pacific Ring of Fire and experience major earthquakes.","Copper has long been one of my most important exports.","My territory reaches towards Patagonia and the islands near Cape Horn.","I share my longest international border with Argentina.","I form a long strip down the western edge of South America.","My capital is Santiago."],t.s)
