B.Uf=s(["My federal union comprises 28 states and eight union territories.","My constitution recognises 22 scheduled languages.","The Western Ghats and Eastern Ghats run near opposite sides of my peninsula.","The Himalayas rise along much of my northern frontier.","The Ganges is one of my most culturally and spiritually significant rivers.","I became independent from British rule in 1947.","The Taj Mahal stands in my city of Agra.","My film industry includes the Hindi-language cinema commonly called Bollywood.","I occupy a vast triangular peninsula extending into the Indian Ocean.","My capital is New Delhi."],t.s)
