B.Tt=s(["I distribute national capital functions among Pretoria, Cape Town and Bloemfontein.","I have nine provinces and 12 official languages, including South African Sign Language.","The independent kingdom of Lesotho is completely surrounded by my territory.","My currency is the rand.","The Drakensberg contains my highest mountain landscapes.","Robben Island lies offshore from one of my best-known cities.","I have coastlines on both the Atlantic and Indian oceans.","Nelson Mandela became my first democratically elected president in 1994.","Table Mountain overlooks Cape Town in my south-west.","I occupy the southern tip of the African continent."],t.s)
