B.U5=s(["My sovereign territory includes the Arctic archipelago of Svalbard.","I am part of the European Economic Area but not a member of the European Union.","I share land borders with Sweden, Finland and Russia.","My long, deeply indented coast faces the North Atlantic and Arctic seas.","Oil and natural gas production has played a major role in my modern economy.","The Nobel Peace Prize ceremony is held in my capital.","The midnight sun can be experienced in my northern regions during summer.","I am renowned for spectacular fjords such as Geirangerfjord.","I form the long western side of the Scandinavian Peninsula.","My capital is Oslo."],t.s)
