B.RF=s(["I separated from the Indian subcontinent tens of millions of years ago after earlier splitting from Africa.","I am generally described as the world's fourth-largest island.","An exceptionally high proportion of my plants and animals are endemic.","My landscapes include eastern rainforests, central highlands and a dry, spiny southern region.","Several species of baobab grow here, including species found nowhere else.","The Mozambique Channel separates me from mainland Africa.","My people and language reflect both African and Austronesian ancestry.","Every wild species of lemur is native to me.","I am a large island nation off the south-eastern coast of Africa.","My capital is Antananarivo."],t.s)
