B.Rb=s(["Two prominent peninsulas extend from my mainland: one in the north-west and another in the south-east.","My federal system contains 32 entities, including my capital.","The Sierra Madre Occidental and Sierra Madre Oriental cross much of my territory.","My shores meet the Pacific Ocean, Gulf of Mexico and Caribbean Sea.","The Olmec, Maya and Aztec civilisations all flourished within my modern borders.","My war of independence from Spain began in 1810 and concluded in 1821.","The Day of the Dead and mariachi music are strongly associated with my culture.","My currency is the peso.","I border the United States, Guatemala and Belize.","My capital is Mexico City."],t.s)
