B.Ri=s(["My ISO 4217 code is CHF.","My issuing central bank was founded in 1907.","I am divided into 100 smaller units whose name varies by language region.","I am frequently described as a safe-haven currency.","My banknotes reflect a country with four national languages.","The Swiss National Bank is responsible for issuing me.","I am also the official currency of Liechtenstein.","My country is famous for the Alps, watches and chocolate.","The abbreviation 'Fr.' is commonly used for me.","I am the currency of Switzerland."],t.s)
