B.Td=s(["My ISO 4217 code is THB.","I am divided into 100 satang.","My name was historically associated with a unit of weight used for precious metals.","The Bank of Thailand is responsible for issuing me.","My coins and banknotes prominently feature the reigning monarch.","My symbol resembles a capital B crossed by a vertical stroke.","I am used in a Southeast Asian constitutional monarchy.","Visitors use me in Bangkok, Chiang Mai and Phuket.","I am the official currency of Thailand.","My four-letter name rhymes with 'part'."],t.s)
