B.Rs=s(["My ISO 4217 code is CAD.","The Bank of Canada first issued banknotes in 1935.","My current banknotes are made from a single piece of polymer.","English and French both appear on my banknotes.","I am divided into 100 cents.","My one-dollar coin is commonly nicknamed the loonie.","My two-dollar coin is commonly nicknamed the toonie.","My symbol is often written as C$ to distinguish me from other dollars.","I am used from British Columbia to Newfoundland and Labrador.","I am the official currency of Canada."],t.s)
