B.R5=s(["My ISO 4217 code is JPY.","I was formally adopted under monetary reforms in 1871.","My name derives from a word meaning 'round object'.","I am one of the world's most heavily traded currencies.","My smallest denominations in everyday use are coins rather than decimal fractions.","The Bank of Japan issues my banknotes.","My international symbol is the same basic symbol used for China's yuan.","My coins include one with a central hole.","I am used in Tokyo, Osaka and Kyoto.","I am the currency of Japan."],t.s)
