B.QG=s(["My ISO 4217 code is INR.","The Reserve Bank of India is responsible for issuing most of my banknotes.","I am divided into 100 paise.","My modern symbol was officially adopted in 2010.","My symbol combines features of the Devanagari letter ra and the Latin capital R.","A language panel on my banknotes reflects the linguistic diversity of my country.","My symbol has two horizontal lines across its upper section.","People use me in Delhi, Mumbai, Kolkata and Chennai.","My symbol is \u20b9.","I am the official currency of India."],t.s)
