B.SI=s(["My design was selected through an international competition.","Walter Burley Griffin played a major role in planning me.","I was formally named in 1913.","I was created to resolve a rivalry between two larger cities.","A large artificial lake lies near my centre.","Parliament House is one of my principal landmarks.","I am located within a self-governing inland territory.","Sydney and Melbourne are both larger than me.","I am the seat of Australia\u2019s federal government.","I am the capital of Australia."],t.s)
