B.PO=s(["My central plan is associated with urban planner L\xfacio Costa.","Oscar Niemeyer designed many of my most famous buildings.","I was inaugurated in 1960.","My layout is often compared to an aeroplane or bird.","I was built as a carefully planned modern city.","I replaced a coastal city as the national capital.","I am recognised as a UNESCO World Heritage Site.","I lie within Brazil\u2019s Federal District.","Rio de Janeiro was the capital before me.","I am the capital of Brazil."],t.s)
