B.Te=s(["I was previously known by the M\u0101ori name Te Whanganui-a-Tara.","Strong winds have inspired one of my best-known nicknames.","I sit beside a large natural harbour.","Hills rise steeply around much of my urban centre.","The Beehive houses government offices here.","I am located near the southern end of an island.","Auckland has a much larger population than me.","I am closely associated with New Zealand\u2019s film industry.","I am often described as the world\u2019s southernmost national capital.","I am the capital of New Zealand."],t.s)
