B.SD=s(["I was developed as a purpose-built city near the geographical centre of my country.","A prominent rock formation rises above my surroundings.","My master plan was created during the 1970s.","I officially became the national capital in 1991.","Zuma Rock stands near one of the principal routes leading to me.","My National Mosque has a large golden dome.","I replaced a crowded coastal city as the capital.","Lagos remains my country\u2019s largest city.","I am located within a federal capital territory.","I am the capital of Nigeria."],t.s)
B.ZX=new A.aX("countries_capitals_0005","Abuja","assets/images/categories/countries/capitals/countries_capitals_0005_abuja.webp",B.SD,B.N)
B.Ry=s(["Queen Victoria selected me as the seat of government in 1857.","I developed near the meeting point of three rivers.","My Rideau Canal becomes a famous skating route during winter.","Parliament Hill overlooks one of my waterways.","I share my metropolitan area with a city in another province.","English and French are widely used here.","Toronto, Montreal and Vancouver are all larger than me.","I am located in the province of Ontario.","My country\u2019s Parliament meets here.","I am the capital of Canada."],t.s)
B.ZM=new A.aX("countries_capitals_0006","Ottawa","assets/images/categories/countries/capitals/countries_capitals_0006_ottawa.webp",B.Ry,B.N)
B.Tf=s(["My ancient citadel stands on a hill above the old city.","I was historically associated with Angora wool and Angora cats.","An\u0131tkabir, a monumental mausoleum, is one of my major landmarks.","I lie on the central Anatolian plateau.","I became the headquarters of a nationalist movement after the First World War.","I replaced a much larger city as the national capital.","I officially became the capital in 1923.","Istanbul remains my country\u2019s largest city.","I am the seat of the Turkish government.","I am the capital of T\xfcrkiye."],t.s)
B.a_D=new A.aX("countries_capitals_0007","Ankara","assets/images/categories/countries/capitals/countries_capitals_0007_ankara.webp",B.Tf,B.N)
B.QJ=s(["My name comes from a Maasai phrase referring to cool water.","I began as a railway depot near the end of the nineteenth century.","I am sometimes called the Green City in the Sun.","A national park borders my urban area.","The headquarters of several United Nations organisations are located here.","I lie close to the eastern edge of the Great Rift Valley.","I replaced Mombasa as the capital of a former protectorate.","I am the largest city in Kenya.","I am one of East Africa\u2019s principal economic centres.","I am the capital of Kenya."],t.s)
