B.Rf=s(["I celebrated one thousand years since my foundation in 2010.","For centuries I was known as Th\u0103ng Long, meaning Ascending Dragon.","The Temple of Literature is one of my oldest landmarks.","My Old Quarter is traditionally associated with 36 streets.","Ho\xe0n Ki\u1ebfm Lake lies near my historic centre.","The Red River flows beside me.","The Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum is located here.","I lie in the northern part of my country.","Ho Chi Minh City is larger than me.","I am the capital of Vietnam."],t.s)
